      "id": "claim_25b956f5858e42dcbe559ea6955ab44b",
      "statement": "packages/core/src/index.ts re-exports the port declarations with `export type *` and, since M3, also `export * from './interview/index.ts'` — so importing @chrysalyst/core now emits the interview logic's runtime bindings while still opening no socket, reading no file, and touching no clock.",
