    {
      "id": "claim_bed86f734fac4b02b4c7d5399a08eefa",
      "statement": "CoreDependencies<TState> makes `llm`, `sessions` and `clock` required and `search` the single optional member, so the domain can run an interview without web enrichment but the compiler forces every caller to handle an absent search.",
