      "id": "claim_0d9012454ba1464c9b2e397d854ced88",
      "statement": "SessionStorePort<TState> is generic over the persisted state and deliberately omits a delete method; load resolves undefined for an identifier that was never saved but rejects when a record is present and cannot be read back, so undefined reports absence alone and never a failed load.",
